<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><oois xmlns="http://www.outdooractive.com/api/"><tour id="810804249" type="5250" frontendtype="tour" ranking="65.0"><category id="1589846" name="Trails" iconUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/maroon/mountainbiking.square_vector.svg" iconInactiveUrl="https://res.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/grey80/mountainbiking.square_vector.svg" iconMapUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/maroon/mountainbiking.map_vector.svg" iconInactiveMapUrl="https://res.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/grey80/mountainbiking.map_vector.svg" iconTransparentUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/mountainbiking.geocontent.png" strokeColor="#ff0000" mapOverlays="mtb"><datatype>mountainbiking</datatype></category><title>SH 83 Scheeleitn-Line</title><localizedTitle lang="en"><value>SH 83 Scheeleitn-Line</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="fr"><value>SH 83 Scheeleitn-Line</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="it"><value>SH 83 Scheeleitn-Line</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="es"><value>SH 83 Scheeleitn-Line</value></localizedTitle><shortText>&lt;b>ScheeLeitn-Line – Progressiv mit Airtime&lt;/b>&#xd;
&lt;p>Die ScheeLeitn-Line ist modern gebaut und auf einen aktiven, flüssigen Fahrstil ausgelegt. Sauber geformte Anlieger, Wellen und gut platzierte Sprünge geben dem Trail einen klaren Rhythmus und laden dazu ein, Geschwindigkeit mitzunehmen.&lt;/p>&#xd;
&lt;p>Ein zentrales Element ist die Airtime: Viele der Features sind so angelegt, dass sie sowohl gerollt als auch gesprungen werden können. Wer den richtigen Flow findet, hebt immer wieder kontrolliert ab, ohne dass der Trail unübersichtlich wird.&lt;/p></shortText><longText>Der Streckenverlauf bleibt dabei gut lesbar und bietet genügend Raum, sich schrittweise an größere Sprünge heranzutasten.&#xd;
&lt;p>Der Charakter: progressiv, dynamisch und verspielt – mit Fokus auf Flow und Airtime. Ein Trail für Rider, die aktiv fahren und ihre Technik in einem modernen Setup weiterentwickeln wollen.&lt;/p></longText><primaryImage id="628105631"><title>Scheeleitn-Line</title><author>Daniel Roos</author></primaryImage><geometry>12.691383,47.401165,1816 12.691382,47.401133,1814 12.691376,47.401001,1809 12.691263,47.400903,1809 12.691125,47.400704,1806 12.691058,47.400589,1806 12.690963,47.400475,1805 12.690846,47.400379,1803 12.690692,47.400295,1802 12.690499,47.400123,1801 12.690187,47.399983,1799 12.689884,47.399826,1796 12.689705,47.399652,1793 12.68958,47.399491,1791 12.689519,47.399348,1789 12.689498,47.399227,1789 12.689497,47.399093,1788 12.68947,47.399014,1788 12.689423,47.398906,1787 12.689399,47.398767,1785 12.689302,47.398595,1785 12.689233,47.398433,1784 12.689154,47.398301,1783 12.689075,47.398212,1781 12.688997,47.398167,1779 12.688918,47.39814,1779 12.688879,47.398117,1778 12.688782,47.398104,1778 12.688668,47.398068,1777 12.688411,47.39802,1777 12.688267,47.397992,1778 12.688219,47.397967,1777 12.688186,47.397923,1776 12.688178,47.397884,1775 12.688236,47.397843,1773 12.68836,47.39783,1771 12.688516,47.397849,1770 12.688736,47.397918,1771 12.688869,47.397965,1772 12.688967,47.397985,1772 12.689042,47.397976,1771 12.689082,47.39795,1769 12.689073,47.39792,1768 12.689038,47.397893,1768 12.688972,47.397866,1768 12.688925,47.397855,1768 12.688892,47.397842,1768 12.688846,47.397823,1767 12.688806,47.397809,1767 12.688578,47.397721,1766 12.688316,47.397658,1766 12.688211,47.397615,1765 12.688178,47.39758,1764 12.688186,47.397541,1762 12.688221,47.397515,1761 12.688329,47.39749,1758 12.688419,47.397485,1757 12.688847,47.397529,1757 12.689049,47.397544,1756 12.689098,47.397523,1754 12.689099,47.397483,1752 12.689088,47.397457,1750 12.689012,47.39743,1751 12.688683,47.397328,1748 12.688354,47.397242,1747 12.688201,47.39722,1747 12.688111,47.397191,1747 12.68808,47.3